msgid ""
"Set to the number of other themes or modules that will be <a href=\"https://"
"editoria11y.princeton.edu/configuration/#customtests\">injecting custom "
"result JS events</a>."
msgstr ""
"Iestatiet uz citu motīvu vai moduļu skaitu, kas <a href=\"https://"
"editoria11y.princeton.edu/configuration/#customtests\">injicēs pielāgotus "
"rezultātu JS notikumus</a>."

msgid "Positioning"
msgstr "Novietojums"

msgid "Don't show edit links on tips in these containers"
msgstr "Nerādīt rediģēšanas saites padomos šajos konteineros"

msgid ""
"Tips show copies of the \"Edit\" and \"Layout\" links for nodes, users and "
"taxonomy terms. These links are not helpful on lists of content from remote "
"nodes.<br>Provide a comma-separated list of page sections of where these "
"links should not show, E.g.: <code><em>#sidebar-menu, .news-feed</em></code>."
"<br>To hide the links <strong>everywhere</strong>, set this field to an "
"asterisk (<code><em>*</em></code>).<br>To modify the links, <a "
"href=\"https://editoria11y.princeton.edu/configuration/#modify-tips\" "
"target=\"_blank\">use the ed11yPop event</a> in your theme JS."
msgstr ""
"Padomi rāda mezglu, lietotāju un taksonomijas terminu \"Rediģēt\" un "
"\"Izkārtojums\" saišu kopijas. Šīs saites nav noderīgas attālu mezglu satura "
"sarakstos.<br>Norādiet ar komatu atdalītu lapas sadaļu sarakstu, kur šīs "
"saites nerādīt, piemēram: <code><em>#sidebar-menu, .news-feed</em></code>."
"<br>Lai slēptu saites <strong>visur</strong>, iestatiet šo lauku uz "
"zvaigznīti (<code><em>*</em></code>).<br>Lai modificētu saites, <a "
"href=\"https://editoria11y.princeton.edu/configuration/#modify-tips\" "
"target=\"_blank\">izmantojiet ed11yPop notikumu</a> jūsu motīva JS."

msgid "Pin panel to..."
msgstr "Piespraust paneli..."

msgid "Right"
msgstr "Pa labi"

msgid "Left"
msgstr "Pa kreisi"

msgid "Don't cover these other widgets"
msgstr "Neaizklāt šos citus logrīkus"

msgid ""
"Provide a comma-separated list of selectors for other things that appear in "
"the bottom right of the page. <br>If nothing is set, Editoria11y will "
"automatically slide left to accommodate <code><em>#klaro_toggle_dialog, "
"#klaro-cookie-notice .same-page-preview-dialog.ui-dialog-position-side</em></"
"code>."
msgstr ""
"Norādiet ar komatu atdalītu selektoru sarakstu citām lietām, kas parādās "
"lapas apakšējā labajā stūrī. <br>Ja nekas nav iestatīts, Editoria11y "
"automātiski pārbīdīsies pa kreisi, lai pielāgotos "
"<code><em>#klaro_toggle_dialog, #klaro-cookie-notice .same-page-preview-"
"dialog.ui-dialog-position-side</em></code>."

msgid "Elements with overflow hidden"
msgstr "Elementi ar overflow hidden"

msgid ""
"Sometimes buttons get drawn and visually truncated outside the bounds of a "
"positioned element. Provide a selector list."
msgstr ""
"Dažreiz pogas tiek uzzīmētas un vizuāli saīsinātas ārpus pozicionēta "
"elementa robežām. Norādiet selektoru sarakstu."

msgid "Theme JS will handle revealing hidden tooltips inside these containers"
msgstr "Motīva JS apstrādās slēpto rīkpadomu atklāšanu šajos konteineros"

msgid ""
"Editoria11y detects hidden tooltips and warns the user when they try to jump "
"to them from the panel. For elements on this list, Editoria11y will <a "
"href=\"https://itmaybejj.github.io/editoria11y/#dealing-with-alerts-on-"
"hidden-or-size-constrained-content\">dispatch a JS event</a> instead of a "
"warning, so custom JS in your theme can first reveal the hidden tip (e.g., "
"open an accordion or tab panel)."
msgstr ""
"Editoria11y nosaka slēptus rīkpadomus un brīdina lietotāju, kad tie mēģina "
"uz tiem pāriet no paneļa. Šī saraksta elementiem Editoria11y <a "
"href=\"https://itmaybejj.github.io/editoria11y/#dealing-with-alerts-on-"
"hidden-or-size-constrained-content\">nosūtīs JS notikumu</a> brīdinājuma "
"vietā, lai pielāgotais JS jūsu motīvā vispirms varētu atklāt slēpto padomu "
"(piemēram, atvērt akordeonu vai cilnes paneli)."

msgid "Detecting dynamic and shadow content"
msgstr "Dinamiskā un ēnu satura noteikšana"

msgid "Dynamically refresh if new content appears"
msgstr "Dinamiski atsvaidzināt, ja parādās jauns saturs"

msgid "Watch for changes anywhere on the page"
msgstr "Sekot izmaiņām jebkurā lapas vietā"

msgid "Only watch for changes to content containers present on load"
msgstr "Sekot tikai izmaiņām satura konteineros, kas klāt ielādes laikā"

msgid "Do not watch for changes"
msgstr "Nesekot izmaiņām"

msgid ""
"Set to \"anywhere\" if changes are being missed, set to \"ignore\" if you "
"notice performance issues. Themes and modules can also call "
"<code>Drupal.Ed11y.refresh()</code> to refresh results."
msgstr ""
"Iestatiet uz \"jebkur\", ja izmaiņas tiek nokavētas; iestatiet uz "
"\"ignorēt\", ja pamanāt veiktspējas problēmas. Motīvi un moduļi var arī "
"izsaukt <code>Drupal.Ed11y.refresh()</code>, lai atsvaidzinātu rezultātus."

msgid "Check inside these specific Web components"
msgstr "Pārbaudīt šajos konkrētajos tīmekļa komponentos"

msgid ""
"Provide selectors for elements with <a href='https://developer.mozilla.org/"
"en-US/docs/Web/Web_Components'>shadow DOM</a> you want tested. E.g.: "
"<code><em>my-fancy-accordion-widget, my-magical-slideshow</em></code>."
msgstr ""
"Norādiet selektorus elementiem ar <a href='https://developer.mozilla.org/en-"
"US/docs/Web/Web_Components'>shadow DOM</a>, kurus vēlaties pārbaudīt. "
"Piemēram: <code><em>my-fancy-accordion-widget, my-magical-slideshow</em></"
"code>."

msgid "Auto-detect any Web components"
msgstr "Automātiski noteikt jebkādus tīmekļa komponentus"

msgid ""
"This is easier to configure than specifying components, but may slow test "
"runs on very complicated pages."
msgstr ""
"To ir vieglāk konfigurēt nekā komponentu norādīšanu, taču tas var palēnināt "
"testu palaišanu ļoti sarežģītās lapās."

msgid "Syncing results to reports"
msgstr "Rezultātu sinhronizācija ar pārskatiem"

msgid ""
"Remember that results only sync to the dashboard when viewing nodes. Results "
"shown while editing or viewing previews or revisions will not sync."
msgstr ""
"Atcerieties, ka rezultāti sinhronizējas ar paneli tikai mezglu skatīšanas "
"laikā. Rezultāti, kas rādīti rediģēšanas vai priekšskatījuma/revīziju "
"skatīšanas laikā, netiks sinhronizēti."

msgid "Remove redundant base url from URLs"
msgstr "Noņemt lieko bāzes URL no URL"

msgid ""
"Provide base URL (\"/mysite\") if your site is installed in a subdirectory. "
"Subdirectories tend to get duplicated (/mysite/mysite/mypage) and throw "
"errors from the API."
msgstr ""
"Norādiet bāzes URL (\"/mysite\"), ja jūsu vietne ir instalēta "
"apakšdirektorijā. Apakšdirektoriji mēdz dubultot (/mysite/mysite/mypage) un "
"radīt kļūdas API."

msgid "Preserve query parameters"
msgstr "Saglabāt vaicājuma parametrus"

msgid ""
"The dashboard ignores most parameters: results for both /news?f=1 and /news?"
"f=2 will show up as just /news. Provide a comma separated list of parameters "
"that are meaningful, and should appear as separate pages in results."
msgstr ""
"Panelis ignorē lielāko daļu parametru: rezultāti gan /news?f=1, gan /news?"
"f=2 parādīsies kā /news. Norādiet ar komatu atdalītu nozīmīgu parametru "
"sarakstu, kuriem jāparādās kā atsevišķām lapām rezultātos."

msgid "Disable sync altogether"
msgstr "Atspējot sinhronizāciju pavisam"

msgid ""
"Syncing test results back to Drupal is required for the <a target=\"_blank\" "
"href=\"/admin/reports/editoria11y\">issue</a> and <a target=\"_blank\" "
"href=\"/admin/reports/editoria11y/dismissals\">dismissal</a> dashboards and "
"\"mark OK\" buttons."
msgstr ""
"Testu rezultātu sinhronizācija ar Drupal ir nepieciešama <a "
"target=\"_blank\" href=\"/admin/reports/editoria11y\">problēmu</a> un <a "
"target=\"_blank\" href=\"/admin/reports/editoria11y/"
"dismissals\">noraidījumu</a> paneļiem un \"atzīmēt OK\" pogām."

msgid "Heading outline position of editable content"
msgstr "Rediģējamā satura virsrakstu struktūras pozīcija"

msgid ""
"To check headings in CKEditor, Editoria11y needs to know what the first "
"heading level should be in this field. Body fields should generally be at "
"the h2 level."
msgstr ""
"Lai pārbaudītu virsrakstus CKEditor, Editoria11y jāzina, kādam jābūt "
"pirmajam virsraksta līmenim šajā laukā. Pamatteksta laukiem parasti jābūt h2 "
"līmenī."

msgid "H2 level fields (body content)"
msgstr "H2 līmeņa lauki (pamatteksta saturs)"

msgid ""
"Body fields on nodes are preceded by an h1, and their heading outline should "
"start with an h2. Ideally set this for top-level body fields for each of "
"your content types, and set blocks and embedded nodes to h3 or h4.\n"
"        <br>Set all content types: <code><em>form[id^=\"node-\"] #edit-body-"
"wrapper .ck-content</em></code>\n"
"        <br>Set specific content types: <code><em>form[id^=\"node-\"] #edit-"
"body-wrapper .ck-content</em></code>\n"
"        <br>Set up for Gutenberg: <code><em>form[id^=\"node-\"] #edit-body-"
"wrapper .is-root-container</em></code>"
msgstr ""
"Mezglu pamatteksta lauki seko h1, un to virsrakstu struktūrai jāsākas ar h2. "
"Ideālā gadījumā iestatiet to augstākā līmeņa pamatteksta laukiem katram "
"satura tipam, un iestatiet blokus un iegultos mezglus uz h3 vai h4.\n"
"        <br>Iestatīt visus satura tipus: <code><em>form[id^=\"node-\"] #edit-"
"body-wrapper .ck-content</em></code>\n"
"        <br>Iestatīt konkrētus satura tipus: <code><em>form[id^=\"node-\"] "
"#edit-body-wrapper .ck-content</em></code>\n"
"        <br>Iestatīt Gutenberg: <code><em>form[id^=\"node-\"] #edit-body-"
"wrapper .is-root-container</em></code>"

msgid "H3 level fields (blocks or paragraphs with separate titles)"
msgstr "H3 līmeņa lauki (bloki vai rindkopas ar atsevišķiem virsrakstiem)"

msgid ""
"Sometimes inline and layout builder blocks are grouped under an h2 from a "
"separate field, so their highest heading level should be h3."
msgstr ""
"Dažreiz iekļauti un izkārtojuma veidotāja bloki tiek grupēti zem h2 no "
"atsevišķa lauka, tāpēc to augstākajam virsraksta līmenim jābūt h3."

msgid "H4 level fields (deeply nested blocks or paragraphs)"
msgstr "H4 līmeņa lauki (dziļi ligzdoti bloki vai rindkopas)"

msgid ""
"Sometimes inline and layout builder blocks are grouped under an h3 from a "
"separate field, so their highest heading level should be h4."
msgstr ""
"Dažreiz iekļauti un izkārtojuma veidotāja bloki tiek grupēti zem h3 no "
"atsevišķa lauka, tāpēc to augstākajam virsraksta līmenim jābūt h4."

msgid "Modify tests that usually detect content issues"
msgstr "Modificēt testus, kas parasti nosaka satura problēmas"

msgid "Modify tests that usually detect template or configuration issues"
msgstr ""
"Modificēt testus, kas parasti nosaka veidnes vai konfigurācijas problēmas"

msgid "Do not check contrast for these elements"
msgstr "Nepārbaudīt kontrastu šiem elementiem"

msgid ""
"Provide a comma-separated list of selectors for elements to ignore for all "
"users."
msgstr ""
"Norādiet ar komatu atdalītu selektoru sarakstu elementiem, ko ignorēt visiem "
"lietotājiem."

msgid "Remind editor that content in these embeds needs manual review"
msgstr ""
"Atgādināt redaktoram, ka saturs šajos iegultos elementos prasa manuālu "
"pārskatu"

msgid ""
"Provide a comma-separated list of selectors you wish to flag for the editor, "
"e.g.: <code><em>.my-embedded-feed, #my-social-link-block</em></code>."
msgstr ""
"Norādiet ar komatu atdalītu selektoru sarakstu, ko vēlaties atzīmēt "
"redaktoram, piemēram: <code><em>.my-embedded-feed, #my-social-link-block</"
"em></code>."

msgid ""
"Default settings should work with both <a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/"
"project/linkpurpose\" target=\"_blank\">Link Purpose Icons</a> and <a "
"target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.drupal.org/project/extlink\">External "
"Links</a>."
msgstr ""
"Noklusējuma iestatījumiem vajadzētu darboties gan ar <a href=\"https://"
"www.drupal.org/project/linkpurpose\" target=\"_blank\">Link Purpose Icons</"
"a>, gan ar <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.drupal.org/project/"
"extlink\">External Links</a>."

msgid "Remind the editor that these linked documents need a manual check"
msgstr ""
"Atgādināt redaktoram, ka šie saistītie dokumenti prasa manuālu pārbaudi"

msgid ""
"Add or remove filetypes. Set to \"false\" to disable the test altogether. "
"Providing any value will override the default, which is "
"<code><em>a[href$='.pdf'], a[href*='.pdf?']</em></code>."
msgstr ""
"Pievienot vai noņemt failu tipus. Iestatiet uz \"false\", lai pilnībā "
"atspējotu testu. Jebkuras vērtības norādīšana pārrakstīs noklusējumu, kas ir "
"<code><em>a[href$='.pdf'], a[href*='.pdf?']</em></code>."

msgid "Remove elements that match these selectors before testing link text"
msgstr ""
"Pirms saites teksta pārbaudes noņemt elementus, kas atbilst šiem selektoriem"

msgid ""
"Provide a CSS selector of elements your modules programmatically add to "
"links (usually external or open-in-new-window links), so they can be ignored "
"when the link text is checked for the \"link has no text\" and \"link text "
"is not meaningful\" tests.<br>E.g.: <code><em>.this, .that</em></code>"
msgstr ""
"Norādiet CSS selektoru elementiem, ko jūsu moduļi programmatiski pievieno "
"saitēm (parasti ārējas vai jaunā logā atvērtas saites), lai tos varētu "
"ignorēt, pārbaudot saites tekstu \"saitei nav teksta\" un \"saites teksts "
"nav jēgpilns\" testos.<br>Piemēram: <code><em>.this, .that</em></code>"

msgid "Remove these strings before testing link text"
msgstr "Pirms saites teksta pārbaudes noņemt šīs virknes"

msgid ""
"Provide a pipe-separated (\"|\") list of phrases your modules "
"programmatically add to links to hint a purpose (external, mail, phone, open-"
"in-new-window), so they can be ignored when the link text is checked for the "
"\"link has no text\" and \"link text is not meaningful\" tests; e.g.:  "
"<pre><code><em>(link is external)|(link sends email)</em></code></pre>"
msgstr ""
"Norādiet ar vertikālu svītru (\"|\") atdalītu frāžu sarakstu, ko jūsu moduļi "
"programmatiski pievieno saitēm, lai norādītu mērķi (ārēja, e-pasts, "
"tālrunis, jauns logs), lai tos varētu ignorēt saites teksta pārbaudes laikā; "
"piemēram:  <pre><code><em>(link is external)|(link sends email)</em></code></"
"pre>"

msgid "Strings in links that indicate new tabs"
msgstr "Virknes saitēs, kas norāda jaunas cilnes"

msgid ""
"Provide a pipe-separated list of phrases your site uses to warn users a link "
"opens in a new tab; e.g.:  <pre><code><em>new&nbsp;tab|new&nbsp;window|"
"external</em></code></pre>"
msgstr ""
"Norādiet ar vertikālu svītru atdalītu frāžu sarakstu, ko jūsu vietne "
"izmanto, lai brīdinātu lietotājus, ka saite tiek atvērta jaunā cilnē; "
"piemēram:  <pre><code><em>new&nbsp;tab|new&nbsp;window|external</em></code></"
"pre>"

msgid ""
"Modules like Link Purpose or External Links can mark links automatically."
msgstr ""
"Tādi moduļi kā Link Purpose vai External Links var automātiski atzīmēt "
"saites."

